### WT migration delta (observed — DE/other peer)
- `ooda/std/os/fs.oo`: `fs_write_file` → `&FsWriteCap`; `fs_read_file`/`path_exists`/`file_size` → `&FsReadCap`
- `std/src/fs.oo`: `fs_write_file` → `&FsWriteCap`; `fs_read_file` → `&FsReadCap`

========================================================================
1) STATIC — signatures: read=FsReadCap, write=FsWriteCap, no FsRead on write
========================================================================

- `ooda/std/os/fs.oo`: `pub fn fs_write_file(fs: &FsWriteCap, ...)` → `write_file(fs, ...)`; `pub fn fs_read_file(fs: &FsReadCap, ...)` → `read_file(fs, ...)`
- `std/src/fs.oo`: `pub fn fs_write_file(fs: &FsWriteCap, ...)` → `fs_write(fs, ...)`; `pub fn fs_read_file(fs: &FsReadCap, ...)` → `fs_read(fs, ...)`

**Claim 1+2 (sig):** PASS — write params are FsWriteCap only; read params are FsReadCap only.
**Claim 3 (sig):** PASS — no write function takes `&FsReadCap`.

