2) STATIC — sealed map + runtime (CAP-G2 contract)
========================================================================

- `sealed_fs_kind_of`: `read_file`/`fs_read`/`path_exists`/`file_size` → `FsReadCap`; `write_file`/`fs_write` → `FsWriteCap`.
